   118	- Never read, modify, restart or stop anything belonging to Etho: `~/work/etho`, its tmux sessions,
   119	  processes, services, cron lines, Tailscale/Funnel config or ports.
   120	- Don't install or upgrade system packages, and never use `sudo`.
